      }
    },
    {
      "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneIII_3.12/p@131462",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOLABELLA.\nCaesar, ’tis his schoolmaster—\nAn argument that he is plucked, when hither\nHe sends so poor a pinion of his wing,\nWhich had superfluous kings for messengers\nNot many moons gone by.",
